---

<section id="projects" class="projects-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span class="section-label">// BUILT PROJECTS</span>
    <h2>Things I've Built.</h2>
    <p>Here's what I've been working on lately.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="projects-grid">
    <!-- Neural Network -->
    <a href="/projects/neural-network" class="project-card">
      <div class="project-card-header">
        <h3>Neural-Network</h3>
        <span class="project-arrow">→</span>
      </div>

      <p>
        Learning how Neural Networks and LLMs work by building one from scratch
        in Python.
      </p>

      <div class="project-tags">
        <span>Python</span>
        <span>Neural Networks</span>
        <span>LLMs</span>
      </div>

     
    </a>

    <!-- Shell -->
    <a href="/projects/shell" class="project-card">
      <div class="project-card-header">
        <h3>Shell</h3>
        <span class="project-arrow">→</span>
      </div>

      <p>
        Learning how shells work and System Programming by implementing a custom
        shell in C and C++.
      </p>

      <div class="project-tags">
        <span>C</span>
        <span>C++</span>
        <span>System Programming</span>
        <span>Linux</span>
      </div>

      
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .projects-section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  .section-heading {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    color: #1769ff;
    font-family: monospace;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .section-heading h2 {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .section-heading p {
    color: var(--color-portfolio-muted);
  }

  .projects-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .project-card {
    display: block;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border: 1px solid #dbe3ef;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition:
      transform 0.2s ease,
      box-shadow 0.2s ease,
      border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .project-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: #1769ff;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
  }

  .project-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .project-card-header h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #1769ff;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .project-arrow {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .project-card:hover .project-arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    color: #1769ff;
  }

  .project-card p {
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
    color: var(--color-portfolio-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .project-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .project-tags span {
    padding: 0.3rem 0.55rem;
    border: 1px solid #dbe3ef;
    border-radius: 5px;
    color: var(--color-portfolio-muted);
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .project-code {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-portfolio-muted);
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .project-code span {
    margin-left: 0.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .projects-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
